## Audit or release assessment

Complete `evaluation-review.json` and `EVALUATION-REVIEW.md` using actual evidence.
Missing evidence is unassessed/unrun, not a passing outcome or nonapplicability.
Separate format conformance, documented/observed host behavior, recommendations,
and empirical quality/cost claims. Use justified nonblocking limits or name the
specific release/support claim blocked; do not require a universal certification.
